FADE IN:

INT. OBSERVATORY - NIGHT #1#

Dust hangs in the beam of a single desk lamp. A radio telescope console *blinks* in the dark.

MEERA (40s), sleeves rolled, leans into the glow.

MEERA
(whispering)
That's not noise.

ARJUN (O.S.)
Everything is noise at three in the morning.

ARJUN, 20s, steps into the light holding two cups of chai.

MEERA
Look at the **spacing**.

ARJUN ^
I'm looking at the _clock_.

CUT TO:

